    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39810" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pȳtho</span></b> , ōnis,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a familiar spirit</i>, <i>the demon possessing a
				soothsayer</i> (late Lat.), <i><span class="en">Vulg. Deut.
				18, 11</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puella habens spiritum pythonem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Act. 16, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fecit pythonas, et aruspices multiplicavit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4
					Reg. 21, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
